<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑέτ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rainy, bringing rain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					940b33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					401a18
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1107.4
			</span></i> (Cos. <span class="entity">iii/ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				9
			</span></i> (so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Ὑ.</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Annuario</u>
				8
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				9.321
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rhodes</span>)); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑετιώτερος νότος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Vent.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>belonging to rain,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ ὑ.</span> a fall <i>of rain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ὕδατα</span>
			<i>rain</i>-water, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.911f
			</span></i>tit.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑέτια ἦν</span> it was
				<i>rainy weather,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὐετίων δὲ μὴ ἐχφέρειν</span>
			wool shall not be brought out (for sale) <i>in rainy weather</i>,
				<u>GDI</u>iv <i><span class="en">
				p.876
			</span></i> (Ionia, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑέτιος, ὁ,</span> name of a stone. <i><span class="en">
				Cyran.
				39
			</span></i>.</div>
